You have TWO separate projects:

Backend (NestJS):
Path: C:\Nest\eyada_backend
Swagger URL: http://localhost:3000/api

Frontend (Next.js React):
Path: C:\React\eyada-frontend

Rules:
- Do NOT modify backend code at all
